[[Category:Tmp_xyobj(neg)]]

Badgers are short-legged omnivores, distant relative to [[Otter]] and [[Wolverine]]. Found wandering in forests as well as within [[Badger Sett]]s.

Badger Setts are mini-dungeons inhabited by Badgers as well as large mini-boss badgers named [[Denmother]]s.

==Combat==

===Behaviour===

Very aggressive in a certain radius to everyone, including other animals.

