==Notes==

*If a [[Badger]] and a fox are in close proximity, they will initiate combat and begin to fight one another. Invariably, the Badger will kill the fox. This can be useful for newbies to get an early source of fox materials. It is also possible to initiate combat with the badger while it is fighting the fox, if you start the fight early enough you and the fox together can quite easily kill it.

